error[keywords]: `int16` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:3:26
   │
 2 │ interface Service {
 3 │     void process(in long int16, out string int32);
   ·                          ^^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
 4 │ };
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_int16`

error[keywords]: `int32` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
